  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "四层循环，不是一个 while",
      "items": [
        "① RegularTask::run 任务驱动：run_turn 正常返回且队列还有活就再来一轮（tasks/regular.rs:104）",
        "② run_turn 步进循环：每轮取输入、记录、采样；needs_follow_up 为真就 continue（session/turn.rs:425）",
        "③ try_run_sampling_request 流事件循环：处理 ResponseEvent 直到 Completed（session/turn.rs:2611）",
        "④ run_sampling_request 重试循环：包住③，失败走 handle_response_stream_error（session/turn.rs:1640）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "回合内继续的条件",
      "items": [
        "needs_follow_up = model_needs_follow_up || has_pending_input（session/turn.rs:574）",
        "每轮先 get_pending_input，把插话记成 SteeredUserInput",
        "压缩分两处：回合前 run_pre_sampling_compact，回合内 MidTurn 与 PostTurn 也会触发"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "工具与安全",
      "items": [
        "工具走 ToolCallRuntime，命令审批和补丁审批是两个入口",
        "沙箱 read-only / workspace-write / danger-full-access 由 OS 强制",
        "会话落成 rollout JSONL，codex resume 靠它重建历史"
      ]
    }
  ]
